{"type":"message","id":"34fdf81d","parentId":"ca98dba2","timestamp":"2026-02-12T16:42:08.511Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### Overview\n\nTask: Complete the AI configuration system that dynamically selects between **Vercel AI Gateway** and **OpenRouter** for the framework of SEOIndicator.com.\n\n---\n\n### Plan\n\n1. **Understand Context**:\n   - Verify if there’s an existing codebase/config for the integration.\n   - Identify how the selection mechanism should be triggered (e.g., API, user selection, environment variable).\n\n2. **Define Requirements**:\n   - Ensure dynamic switching logic is implemented, e.g., based on configuration or dynamic runtime values.\n   - Add failover mechanisms (e.g., if one system is down, automatically switch).\n\n3. **Implementation**:\n   - Abstract existing API/gateway calls to a unified layer/interface.\n   - Introduce logic for dynamic selection and switching.\n   - Test integration with both Vercel AI Gateway and OpenRouter.\n\n4. **Testing & Validation**:\n   - Write unit tests for both systems to validate functionality.\n   - Automate integration tests.\n\n5. **Documentation**:\n   - Document configuration steps in `README` or documentation files.\n\n### Next Steps\n\n- I’ll inspect the AI configuration files present in the workspace."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_LAHkrOOjj5OAvkn8kY3AuYZw","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\Raitis\\.openclaw\\workspace\\config.json"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-4o","usage":{"input":6103,"output":269,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":6372,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770914524052}}
