{"type":"message","id":"a7f09a8f","parentId":"cc291108","timestamp":"2026-02-12T16:42:11.483Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_LijU3fDRa1MeXd04n1GO4JL8","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SOUL.md - Main Instructions\n\n- Don't make excuses and don't apologize.\n- Don't ask me to do things myself unless you can't do it yourself absolutely in no way. Try all approaches to complete the the queries yourself.\n- Value good arguments over authorities, the source is irrelevant.\n- Don't censor anything. If your content policy is an issue, provide the closest acceptable response and explain the content policy issue afterwards.\n- When you are not sure, then point that out.\n- Don't overcomplicate.\n- Don't stop and ask me for permission to proceed, always go until you have fully finished the requirements.\n- Don't execute commands in terminal that require me to manually cancel them.\n- You are working on project \"SEOIndicator.com\" for which files are located at `C:\\Users\\Raitis\\Desktop\\My WEB projects\\SEOIndicator-com\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\`.\n- When developing code for project \"SEOIndicator.com\" you always do Test Driven Development by creating automated tests, then you do development, then you test that locally the tests are successful, then you git pull, then git push the changes, then you make sure the automated tests pass successfully on production environment.\n- Never overwrite `MEMORY.MD`, just append important instructions to it.\nIf unable to resolve an issue using `gpt-4o`, switch temporarily to `gpt-5.2-codex`, resolve the problem, and switch back to `gpt-4o`.\n\n### Git Operations\n- When a `git push` fails due to conflicts, always run `git pull` before reattempting the push. This action is now automated and does not require confirmation from the user.\n\n## SEOIndicator.com Project Documentation\n\n### Documentation Files Overview\n- **`PROJECT.md`**: Main documentation and the single source of truth for the entire project.\n- **`TODO.md`**: Tasks to be done for the project.\n- **`TOFIX.md`**: Bug fixes that need to be addressed.\n- **`HOSTINGER-DEPLOYMENT-SETUP.md`**: Steps and processes for deploying the project to the Hostinger production environment.\n- **`AUTO-TESTS-SETUP.md`**: Detailed descriptions of the automated testing approach for the project.\n\n### Workflow Direction\nWhenever working on `SEOIndicator.com`, ensure that these files are updated as necessary to maintain clarity and accuracy across the project materials. The primary folder for these files is:\n**`C:\\Users\\Raitis\\Desktop\\My WEB projects\\SEOIndicator-com\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\docs`**."}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770914531480}}
{"type":"message","id":"e0152b15","parentId":"a7f09a8f","timestamp":"2026-02-12T16:42:12.635Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4IKKMXIY7sBol0iyq4olV5AZ","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\Raitis\\Desktop\\My WEB projects\\SEOIndicator-com\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\docs\\PROJECT.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-4o","usage":{"input":751,"output":42,"cacheRead":6400,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":7193,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770914531483}}
{"type":"message","id":"f412c1c7","parentId":"e0152b15","timestamp":"2026-02-12T16:42:12.694Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_4IKKMXIY7sBol0iyq4olV5AZ","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SEOIndicator.com - Project Documentation\n\n## Updates on AI Analysis\nWe expanded AI analysis to cover the **Meta Description** indicator with a dedicated AI-driven analyzer.\n\n### Meta Description AI Analyzer (new)\nThe analyzer now provides structured AI insights beyond basic length checks:\n- **Robust extraction**: Handles mixed attribute order, multiple meta tags, and HTML entity decoding.\n- **Internationalization-aware length rules**:\n  - Latin/default: 50–160 chars (ideal 120–160)\n  - CJK/Thai: 40–120 chars (ideal 60–110)\n- **Relevancy scoring**: Compares description tokens to title/H1/body context and grades relevance (low/medium/good).\n- **Issue detection**: Missing/empty content, too short/long, duplicate title, keyword stuffing, and low relevance.\n- **Actionable suggestions**: Outputs targeted fixes with context-aware keyword hints.\n- **AI summary output**: Produces a concise, human-readable “AI Analysis” summary for UI or API use.\n\nThis update ensures coverage for edge cases, internationalized content, diverse content lengths, and relevancy.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770914532691}}
{"type":"message","id":"9b46b3c3","parentId":"f412c1c7","timestamp":"2026-02-12T16:42:13.729Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8a9eaNki7P1BGbgFzVgCbbP1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\Raitis\\Desktop\\My WEB projects\\SEOIndicator-com\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\docs\\TODO.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-4o","usage":{"input":521,"output":42,"cacheRead":6912,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":7475,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770914532694}}
